#: applications/luci-app-smartdns/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/smartdns/smartdns.js:103
msgid ""
"SmartDNS is a local high-performance DNS server, supports finding fastest "
"IP, supports ad filtering, and supports avoiding DNS poisoning."
msgstr ""
"SmartDNS to lokalny serwer DNS o wysokiej wydajności, obsługuje wyszukiwanie "
"najszybszego adresu IP, obsługuje filtrowanie reklam i pomaga unikać "
"zatruwania DNS."

#: applications/luci-app-smartdns/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/smartdns/smartdns.js:1645
